docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/invites` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Creates a password-protected invitation link. A group can have only one active link at a time.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `password` | `string` | Yes | Invite password, 8–72 bytes. |
  | `expires_at` | `string (date-time)` | No | Expiration timestamp; if supplied, it must be in the future. |
  | `max_uses` | `integer` | No | Positive maximum number of successful uses. |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 5,
      "group_id": 42,
      "token": "opaque-token",
      "invite_url": "/api/v1/groups/invites/opaque-token/join",
      "expires_at": "2027-06-07T14:30:00Z",
      "max_uses": 2,
      "used_count": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` — `groupID` is not a positive integer.
  - `400 INVITE_INVALID_PAYLOAD` / `INVITE_INVALID_EXPIRATION` / `INVITE_INVALID_MAX_USES` — Invalid password, expiration, or use limit.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_OWNER_REQUIRED` — Requester is neither the owner nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
  - `409 GROUP_ACTIVE_INVITE_EXISTS` — Group already has a usable invite link.
}
